==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|schrift}}, from {{inh|de|goh|scrift}}, from {{der|de|la|scriptum}}. Abstractum of {{m|de|schreiben||to [[write]]}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|script}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ʃʁɪft/}}
* {{rhymes|de|ɪft}}
* {{audio|de|De-Schrift.oga|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[font]]
#: {{ux|de|Verdana ist die beste '''Schrift''' zur Bildschirmbetrachtung.|Verdana is the best '''font''' for viewing on the computer screen.}}
#: {{syn|de|Schriftart|Font}}
# {{lb|de|mostly in the plural}} [[writing]] {{gloss|work of an author}}
