#: {{syn|de|Text|Werk}}
# [[hand]], [[handwriting]] {{gloss|characteristic writing of a particular person}}
#: {{syn|de|Handschrift}}
# [[script]] (system of writing)
#: {{ux|de|chinesische '''Schrift'''|Chinese script}}

